The local emulator (127.0.0.1:5555) intermittently fails DNS for the mall backend `mall.dusksnow.top` ("ping: Try again"), so the app shows "网络异常" on cold start while the host's curl works. Recovery is to wait (sometimes ~20s) until in-emulator ping resolves, then cold-restart the app; the in-app "重试" button is unreliable (baseline issue).

**Why:** Observed repeatedly on 2026-10-19 in cm-spec26; it caused false failures before the tests waited for network.
**How to apply:** In Harmony Cup mall-app (com.joker.coolmall) self-tests, ping-wait before restarting the app, and report network failures as environment skips, not functional passes or